<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-14T06:49:14.429Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 06:49:14 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel struck Gaza’s Nasser Hospital, killing six people including a doctor, a child and a senior Hamas commander inside the facility. Heavy rains have flooded tens of thousands of tents in Gaza, threatening power and healthcare access and leading to a baby’s death from cold. Humanitarian agencies are urging swift entry of winter supplies as the humanitarian situation worsens amid disputes between Israel and Hamas. A former Hamas bodyguard was identified after being granted British citizenship and alleged to have plotted a terror attack. The United Nations reported 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168796&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/12/lewis-hamilton-gaza-visit-rafah-israel&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxNdTRjZms3YnZaV0JHaXJvN3A1SkJKLXVIMmExTVVXWGRnNXkzSEZVTk5Hcm1udUh6ekowLUl1dkp3OTBscUJ4bzFMakJBcDd0aEJSLW9WS0t5dElUcWNNTUNORlVyNW9INHdPcmJNYktWaGwxc0ZuVVR5c0ZpTGJiMnNMa2pvNFRORjhRVVc2QjVLSGtGTFNWWGZLa2M0SkxiZk04dzFUZGdjNThLOElacVNZWGdxZWNscnRoVm5WbUtrZEVhY1dmU2lPaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNUnBVU3NLb0UyZHlmeWR1ci1YTjNqRGg5Tm5zNXJ3X0U0Y1hjcjVDRUJ0VVJad2FWNThKbjVvaGloUlgwQkFoeTFFcldDekUtSTNSY0xKQlRHYW9sbG91Wk1UOXdEWHFGYnVTMXktbUlNdHBpUHFEblFicURaUlpXcllSQU0?oc=5&qu